WEBVTT

00:02:29.395 --> 00:02:33.691
is by far the most efficient way
to capture CO2 from the atmosphere.

00:02:34.609 --> 00:02:36.360
But if nothing is done,

00:02:36.402 --> 00:02:39.697
that same CO2 goes straight back
into the atmosphere

00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:42.241
when plants decompose or are burned.

00:02:42.283 --> 00:02:45.703
But the good news
is that we can stabilize the carbon

00:02:45.745 --> 00:02:47.997
contained in the leftovers

00:02:48.039 --> 00:02:50.541
from the coffee cherries
of Mister [unclear].

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:55.213
That means we can remove
CO2 year after year

00:02:55.213 --> 00:02:57.215
and help fight climate change.

